SUMMARY:CityFair at the Rose Festival
DESCRIPTION:Make plans for CityFair at the Rose Festival\, May 22 through June 7 on the waterfront. Enjoy rides\, food\, games\, and family fun with a special Buy One\, Get One ticket offer. Use promo code PDXPARENT2026 online. And don’t miss Fred Meyer Junior Parade May 30! \nCityFair spans three full weekends\, with plenty to do each time you visit.
