SUMMARY:Meet the Spring Babies of Frog Pond Farm!
DESCRIPTION:It’s Baby Animal Season at Frog Pond Farm in Wilsonville! \nLooking for things to do with kids near Portland or Salem this spring and summer? \nIt’s all here at Frog Pond Farm. \nCome meet our animals\, including camels\, llamas\, mini donkeys\, goats\, pigs\, cows\, and more. With 10+ acres of space to explore\, this is more than a petting zoo\, it’s a full day of outdoor family fun. \n✔️ Meet & feed 80+ animals\, including spring babies!\n✔️ Bounce\, climb\, and play rain or shine in our covered Bounce Park.\n✔️ Live shows & hands-on farm experiences.\n✔️ Open space for kids to play\, explore\, and connect! \nPerfect for families\, playdates\, and animal lovers of all ages looking for kid-friendly activities near Wilsonville\, Portland\, or Salem. \nGeneral Admission: $13 (ages 2+)\nIncludes all-day access to animals\, shows\, Bounce Park\, and play areas. \nVisit once or come back all season with a Season Pass and watch the babies grow up. \nWant something truly unique? Book a Llama Walk and experience the farm in a whole new way! \nThe best days are farm days. Come experience it yourself at Frog Pond Farm. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/meet-the-spring-babies-of-frog-pond-farm-3/2026-05-26/
LOCATION:Frog Pond Farm\, 2995 SW Advance Rd\, Wilsonville\, OR\, 97070\, United States
CATEGORIES:Animals,Family Fun,Farm,Kids Calendar,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/farm-79-2-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Frog Pond Farm":MAILTO:abbie.frogpondfarm@gmail.com
GEO:45.320231;-122.706487
