SUMMARY:Mr. Ben Family Singalong at Hostel Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Join Portland family musician Mr. Ben for a joyful weekly singalong full of music\, movement\, dancing\, and community connection for little kids and their grownups. \nDesigned for babies\, toddlers\, preschoolers\, and early elementary-aged children\, these interactive performances encourage participation\, imagination\, kindness\, and inclusivity through music. Expect playful folk-rock-inspired songs\, silly moments\, and lots of opportunities to sing and move together. \nFree event; tips greatly appreciated. \nTuesdays\, 5–6 PM\n1810 NW Glisan St\, Portland\, OR 97209
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/live-music-with-mr-ben-tuesdays-at-the-hostel-cafe/2026-05-26/
